{"2660510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OCTOPinbs", "steam_appid": 2660510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3216470, 3267070, 3216390, 3216450, 3216460], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fire has broken out! Deploy to the scene immediately!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A social deduction multiplayer action game for 3-10 people. Players take on the role of firefighters as they rush to the site of a fire, working together to put out the flames. However, artists have infiltrated their ranks! Their goal is to incinerate the stage completely or incapacitate all firefighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On stages full of raging fires and collapsing floors, the situation is constantly evolving. Will the firefighters pull through, or will the machinations of the artists prevail? Dominate the stage and bring your team to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/6b8f3df85e532051178d9e4085108bf5.avif?t=1788221671\" width=1560 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/4f244bda6deb74f7f8daa5bd14f76a23.poster.avif?t=1788221671\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/4f244bda6deb74f7f8daa5bd14f76a23.webm?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/4f244bda6deb74f7f8daa5bd14f76a23.mp4?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Victory Conditions For Firefighters (Octopuses)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce the stage incineration meter to 0% or incapacitate all artists by stuffing them into Octojars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys to Victory: Observe your surroundings and put out fires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put out fires while taking a look into adjacent rooms in all directions to check for any suspicious behavior and expose potential artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/25a6e1a37df0374eb86d45f30e7490a0.poster.avif?t=1788221671\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/25a6e1a37df0374eb86d45f30e7490a0.webm?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/25a6e1a37df0374eb86d45f30e7490a0.mp4?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Victory Conditions For Artists (Squid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the stage incineration meter to 100% or incapacitate all firefighters by stuffing them into Octojars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys to Victory: Put on an act and turn the tables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deceive others by pretending to put out fires, then set more while they aren't looking. Even if you get found out, it's not game over yet! Reveal yourself to power-up and make a comeback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/c4f70bfb04a1bc2a14ca01f4edac6873.avif?t=1788221671\" width=1560 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/2d096f6398395b7c30e28209064f8e14.poster.avif?t=1788221671\" width=760 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/2d096f6398395b7c30e28209064f8e14.webm?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/2d096f6398395b7c30e28209064f8e14.mp4?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Hitting 0 HP Isn't the End!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your HP is reduced to 0 by fires or damage from other players, your equipment will break and you'll be reduced to a powerless, helmeted form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If that happens, make a beeline for the fire truck to grab a new body and dive back into the fray!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you get put in an Octojar, that's the end of the line. (You can still watch the match from other players' perspectives from the Octojar!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/3b3aa80f8274e2e0d7aa1f86a38bed5f.avif?t=1788221671\" width=875 height=328 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Capture Suspects in Octojars! Reveal the Truth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuff suspicious players into Octojars to reveal their identities! If the helmeted player is an artist, that's a win for the firefighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if an innocent firefighter is stuffed inside, the firefighters will lose one of their comrades and the artists will gain an advantage! Monitor the situation and act accordingly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/e7401e4611f48c9cfbb8887c16f478e0.poster.avif?t=1788221671\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/e7401e4611f48c9cfbb8887c16f478e0.webm?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/e7401e4611f48c9cfbb8887c16f478e0.mp4?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ The Artist's Trump Card: Reveal Your True Form and Go for an Upset Victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having your cover blown isn't the end! Artists can choose to reveal their true colors. Their location will be revealed to the firefighters, but in exchange they'll gain new abilities and greatly increase their mobility and HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're close to victory—or have lost all hope but want to go out swinging—this is your chance to go wild and dominate the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/a718b97de220a5135674a0b8b14a0ef0.avif?t=1788221671\" width=1560 height=71 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice various actions or view tutorials to learn the basics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's easy for beginners to get the hang of things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication functions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liven matches up by using emotes or stamps in the lobby before and after matches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the basic rules or fine-tune the settings for high-level gameplay! Play your way with flexible customization options!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fire has broken out! Deploy to the scene immediately!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A social deduction multiplayer action game for 3-10 people. Players take on the role of firefighters as they rush to the site of a fire, working together to put out the flames. However, artists have infiltrated their ranks! Their goal is to incinerate the stage completely or incapacitate all firefighters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On stages full of raging fires and collapsing floors, the situation is constantly evolving. Will the firefighters pull through, or will the machinations of the artists prevail? Dominate the stage and bring your team to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/6b8f3df85e532051178d9e4085108bf5.avif?t=1788221671\" width=1560 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/4f244bda6deb74f7f8daa5bd14f76a23.poster.avif?t=1788221671\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/4f244bda6deb74f7f8daa5bd14f76a23.webm?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/4f244bda6deb74f7f8daa5bd14f76a23.mp4?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Victory Conditions For Firefighters (Octopuses)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce the stage incineration meter to 0% or incapacitate all artists by stuffing them into Octojars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys to Victory: Observe your surroundings and put out fires</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put out fires while taking a look into adjacent rooms in all directions to check for any suspicious behavior and expose potential artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/25a6e1a37df0374eb86d45f30e7490a0.poster.avif?t=1788221671\" width=610 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/25a6e1a37df0374eb86d45f30e7490a0.webm?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/25a6e1a37df0374eb86d45f30e7490a0.mp4?t=1788221671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Victory Conditions For Artists (Squid)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the stage incineration meter to 100% or incapacitate all firefighters by stuffing them into Octojars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keys to Victory: Put on an act and turn the tables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deceive others by pretending to put out fires, then set more while they aren't looking. Even if you get found out, it's not game over yet! Reveal yourself to power-up and make a comeback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/c4f70bfb04a1bc2a14ca01f4edac6873.avif?t=1788221671\" width=1560 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/2d096f6398395b7c30e28209064f8e14.poster.avif?t=1788221671\" width=760 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660510/extras/2d096f6398395b7c30e28209064f8e14.webm?t=17882216